{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given the four equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/423b0e05bdf8f5a99f30de835de73d1b4ed70d77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(1)}\\ 3y-2x=12 \\qquad\\textbf{(2)}\\ -2x-3y=10 \\qquad\\textbf{(3)}\\ 3y+2x=12 \\qquad\\textbf{(4)}\\ 2y+3x=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"652\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The pair representing the perpendicular lines is:\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c914a9d223d70d6f35ebe6e19298535b486e5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{(1) and (4)}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{(1) and (3)}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{(1) and (2)}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{(2) and (4)}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{(2) and (3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"704\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Write each equation in slope-intercept from since the slopes are easier to compare.\n</p><p>Equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> in slope-intercept form is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b77889a82619a7e4df5d712becf2778a4ee7093f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{2}{3}x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"88\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> in slope-intercept form is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/8715f1d0ccde1751e4f0206bd9d92440337627ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{2}{3}x - \\frac{10}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"114\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> in slope-intercept form is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/2/172ac15e82ad62afdd4b751923572e46d9c1f55f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{2}{3}x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104992efa4deaa9a2dfeeec9b331ad0bf628f80a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> in slope-intercept form is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561fd558fdc55e5f4c58f4ad50c0cc27d172377e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{3}{2}x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Remember that if the two lines are perpendicular, then the product of two slopes equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.  Equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104992efa4deaa9a2dfeeec9b331ad0bf628f80a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> satisfy the condition, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.